    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-st010-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-st010-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the Seta ST010 and ST011, the two coprocessors Seta made for the
  Super Nintendo. Both are a NEC uPD96050 carrying Seta's microcode, so this
  runs the program of the part itself rather than a transcription of what
  somebody believed the part computes, and models the interface Seta wrapped
  around it.
keywords:
  - emulation
  - super-nintendo
